## Analysis & Pre-Thinking

- **Core Requirements**: Replace all `alert()` calls with toast/status notifications using DaisyUI components. Keep design compact and integrate with existing notification system.
- **Strategic Approach**: 
  1. Create compact `Toast.vue` component using DaisyUI
  2. Add global `$toast` plugin with methods: `success()`, `error()`, `info()`, `warning()`
  3. Update provided files to replace `alert()` with `this.$toast.error()` or `this.$storex.ui.addNotification()`
  4. Ensure toast auto-dismisses after 3-4 seconds
- **Dependencies & Risks**: Existing notification system in `$storex.ui` stores long-lived notifications; toast will be ephemeral. No conflicts expected.
- **Target Files**: 
  - `src/components/Toast.vue` (NEW)
  - `src/main.ts` (register plugin)
